ese ongoing issues  Warner Brothers has announced an  unconditional refund program for people  who want their money back on the Arkham  Knights team page they wrote we are very  sorry that many of our customers  continue to be unhappy with the pc  version of batman arkham knight we  worked hard to get the game to live up  to the standard you deserve but  understand that many of you are still  experiencing issues so if you're unhappy  with how your copy runs until the end of  2015 Warner Brothers will offer a full  refund regardless  how long he plays a game for you can  also get your money back if you bought  the DLC pass but only if you return it  along with the full game but that's not  all sadly the refund process has hit  some roadblocks to according to an  update from vow for users still running  into play time-based refund rejections  we are looking into what is causing  those please wait to resubmit your  refund until we have this resolved thank  you but there is an option if you fancy  playing the waiting game Warners plan is  to continue to address the issues that  we can fix and talk to you about the  issues that we cannot fix later so did  you buy arkham knight on pc are you  gonna get your money back or wait it out  and see what happens let me know in the  comment box below or come find me on  Twitter I'm at Lucy James games for more  on the Caped Crusader be sure to check  out our coverage on gamespot com and  I'll see you next time
 

